│ --export-http-trace  Include HTTP trace data (timestamps, chunks, headers,   │
│                      socket info) in profile_export.jsonl. Computed metrics  │
│                      (http_req_duration, http_req_waiting, etc.) are always  │
│                      included regardless of this setting. See the HTTP Trace │
